/li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">お宅</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おたく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n4\" href=\"../n4/vocab/\">N4</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">你的家；你的住处；你的家族；你的丈夫；你的机构；贵机构；你</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"179923\"><ruby>近<rp>(</rp><rt>ちか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いうちにお<ruby>宅<rp>(</rp><rt>たく</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>にうかがいます。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">We&#x27;ll visit you one of these days.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">おだいじに</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"v-m\">保重身体；祝早日康复</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"225438\">くれぐれもお<ruby>体<rp>(</rp><rt>からだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をお<ruby>大事<rp>(</rp><rt>だいじ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Please take good care of yourself.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">煽てる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おだてる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">奉承；哄骗；甜言蜜语；怂恿</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"195559\">まず<ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>をおだてておいたほうがいいですよ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">You had better try buttering him up first.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">穏やか</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">おだやか</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"po